### What do you see instead?

_No response_

### Additional information

Puppeteer has had issues with Bun: https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/issues/2316

Also puppeteer and playwright depend on the Node TLS API implementation https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/issues/781#issuecomment-1342820810_

